    "title": "North Bend to host free Halloween Extravaganza in downtown Saturday, Oct. 24 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By News Staff ,\n9 hours ago NORTH BEND, Ore. — Families in North Bend can get a jump on Halloween with a free community celebration planned in downtown later this month. North Bend Main Street is inviting families and community members to its annual Halloween Extravaganza on Saturday, Oct. 24, 2026, from 11 a.m. to 1 p.m. in downtown North Bend. Read full article\n1",
